                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game has some of the most beautiful art I've ever seen. It perfectly balances familiar comforts like bugs and mushrooms with surreal, slightly discomforting, otherworldly, and somehow still cute, art.\n\nI like that there are no words, or instructions given, and I think the length of the game is perfect for both the story it is trying to tell, and also for the gameplay; it could get repetitive if drawn out more.\n\nAlso, it's free. 10/10",
